0 FILE tempest-pendulum.ldr
0 Tempest - Serial Double Pendulum
0 Name: tempest-pendulum.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/tempest-pendulum.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Tempest design assembled with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel exported by the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author is the native serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // One motor moves the support carrier; two serial pendulum arms remain passive.
0 // The free elbow is carried by the upper arm, giving coupled gravity dynamics.
0 // All motion comes from stock connections and unmodified native physics.
0 // Companion: tempest-pendulum.bw. Robot Lab Plain; open model, then Code > To blocks.
0 // Reset the complete model before running and before repeating the demonstration.
0 // Use the supplied program to excite the support and observe both free arms during holds.
0 // Digital kinematic demonstrator; physical assembly and output loading are untested.
